{
  "hooks": ["Carry it. Don't look down."],
  "lines": [
    {
      "bar": 1,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "INTRO1",
      "text": "Freight, grey water, and you're new"
    },
    {
      "bar": 2,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "INTRO1",
      "text": "Weigh it, boy. It's a short strait."
    },
    {
      "bar": 5,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "VAMP1",
      "text": "Everything down here is dust"
    },
    {
      "bar": 6,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "VAMP1",
      "text": "I cussed the winch and let it drop"
    },
    {
      "bar": 7,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "VERSE1",
      "text": "Father crossed tide, ice and war"
    },
    {
      "bar": 8,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "VERSE1",
      "text": "Door was cold. He never sighed."
    },
    {
      "bar": 9,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "CHORUS1",
      "text": "Carry it. Don't look down."
    },
    {
      "bar": 10,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "BRIDGE1",
      "text": "He said that. Now I say it."
    },
    {
      "bar": 13,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "BUILD1",
      "text": "It is not fear. Spark, you can quell."
    },
    {
      "bar": 14,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "BUILD1",
      "text": "Here the bell means the arc is clear"
    },
    {
      "bar": 15,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "FALSE_ENDING1",
      "text": "I thought we were done. Sheer luck, that."
    },
    {
      "bar": 16,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "FALSE_ENDING1",
      "text": "Clear water. Then the light came up."
    },
    {
      "bar": 17,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "DROP1",
      "text": "He never said a word."
    },
    {
      "bar": 20,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "TAG1",
      "text": "That was nineteen years ago."
    },
    {
      "bar": 21,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "REPRISE1",
      "text": "His hands are bad now. Mine too."
    },
    {
      "bar": 22,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "PRECHORUS1",
      "text": "You'll take the front. I'll call it."
    },
    {
      "bar": 23,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "CHORUS2",
      "text": "Carry it. Don't look down."
    },
    {
      "bar": 24,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "REPRISE2",
      "text": "Same rail he stood at. Same bell."
    },
    {
      "bar": 25,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "DROP2",
      "text": "It does not get lighter. It's fine."
    },
    {
      "bar": 26,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "CHORUS3",
      "text": "Carry it. Don't look down."
    },
    {
      "bar": 27,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "POSTCHORUS1",
      "text": "You've got it. That's the whole of it."
    },
    {
      "bar": 28,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "REPRISE3",
      "text": "He'd have liked how you hold it."
    },
    {
      "bar": 29,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "DROP3",
      "text": "He went last winter. Quick, they said."
    },
    {
      "bar": 30,
      "beat": 2.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "section": "TURNAROUND1",
      "text": "So it's you and me and this."
    },
    {
      "bar": 31,
      "beat": 1.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "section": "CODA1",
      "text": "I say it now. He can't hear it."
    }
  ],
